{
    "title": "Careem \u2013 rides, food & more",
    "description": "Meet Careem, the everything app for your everyday needs. Rides, food, groceries, payments and more. \r\nUnlock unlimited savings and exclusive benefits with Careem Plus. \r\n\r\nYalla, simplify your life with a tap. \r\n\r\nCareem Plus \r\nIf you\u2019re looking for value and unlimited savings, this subscription is for you. Save AED 200+ every month and unlock unbelievable benefits on rides, food, dining out, groceries, cleaning, plus more!\r\n*Now in Dubai and Amman only, coming soon to more cities\r\n\r\nGO anywhere\r\nBook a ride or schedule a pick-up for later with affordable and comfortable car types - including city to city*, Hala taxi or local taxi services*. Or explore the city on two wheels with Careem Bike*! Enjoy instant 10% credit back on 10 rides with Careem Plus.\r\nExplore our ride services: Hala taxi |  Comfort, Executive, Premier rides | Careem Bike | Car Rentals\r\n*Services and Careem Plus benefits vary from location to location\r\n\r\nEAT everything \r\nGet your favourite food delivered on time and straight to your door. Customise your order to your liking, and track your food delivery in real time. Or discover Dubai\u2019s finest restaurants with Careem DineOut. \r\nWith Careem Plus you can skip the delivery fee on food and enjoy special discounts on  dining out. \r\n Explore our food services: Food delivery | CareemDineOut \r\n*Services and Careem Plus benefits vary from location to location\r\n\r\nGET anything \r\nGet your groceries delivered in a flash with Quik Groceries and enjoy no delivery fee with Careem Plus.\r\nBook everything from home cleaning to laundry, tickets, salon & spa services and more with just a tap.\r\nExplore our services: Quik Groceries | Laundry | Home Cleaning | Tickets | Salon & Spa | Delivery \r\n*Services and Careem Plus benefits vary from location to location\r\n\r\nPAY anyone\r\nThe easiest way is Careem Pay. Send money abroad, pay your bills, split the check and more, with just a tap. \r\nExplore our services: Send money | Split Bills | Bill Payments | Global transfers \r\n*Now in UAE only, coming soon to more countries",
    "descriptionHTML": "Meet Careem, the everything app for your everyday needs. Rides, food, groceries, payments and more. <br>Unlock unlimited savings and exclusive benefits with Careem Plus. <br><br>Yalla, simplify your life with a tap. <br><br>Careem Plus <br>If you\u2019re looking for value and unlimited savings, this subscription is for you. Save AED 200+ every month and unlock unbelievable benefits on rides, food, dining out, groceries, cleaning, plus more!<br>*Now in Dubai and Amman only, coming soon to more cities<br><br>GO anywhere<br>Book a ride or schedule a pick-up for later with affordable and comfortable car types - including city to city*, Hala taxi or local taxi services*. Or explore the city on two wheels with Careem Bike*! Enjoy instant 10% credit back on 10 rides with Careem Plus.<br>Explore our ride services: Hala taxi |  Comfort, Executive, Premier rides | Careem Bike | Car Rentals<br>*Services and Careem Plus benefits vary from location to location<br><br>EAT everything <br>Get your favourite food delivered on time and straight to your door. Customise your order to your liking, and track your food delivery in real time. Or discover Dubai\u2019s finest restaurants with Careem DineOut. <br>With Careem Plus you can skip the delivery fee on food and enjoy special discounts on  dining out. <br> Explore our food services: Food delivery | CareemDineOut <br>*Services and Careem Plus benefits vary from location to location<br><br>GET anything <br>Get your groceries delivered in a flash with Quik Groceries and enjoy no delivery fee with Careem Plus.<br>Book everything from home cleaning to laundry, tickets, salon &amp; spa services and more with just a tap.<br>Explore our services: Quik Groceries | Laundry | Home Cleaning | Tickets | Salon &amp; Spa | Delivery <br>*Services and Careem Plus benefits vary from location to location<br><br>PAY anyone<br>The easiest way is Careem Pay. Send money abroad, pay your bills, split the check and more, with just a t